# Lista permitida: solo metadatos de dependencias y codigo del API.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!app/
!app/**/
!app/**/*.py

# Defensa adicional para carpetas o archivos sensibles dentro de app/.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.cache
**/.coverage*
**/coverage*
**/htmlcov
**/node_modules
**/credentials*
**/*service-account*
**/*service_account*
**/*serviceAccount*
**/*firebase-adminsdk*
**/secrets*
**/.aws
**/.config
**/.ssh
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.sql
**/*.dump
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/tmp
**/temp
